WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.122
This query recreates the patient analytics view with security invoker enabled.

00:00:05.122 --> 00:00:09.297
It still exposes the same selected analytical columns.

00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:14.432
The key difference is how Postgres evaluates underlying access permissions.

00:00:14.432 --> 00:00:19.256
In a production environment, you would test this with real roles and grants.
